#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:113
msgid "📁 Welcome to Files"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:115
msgid ""
"<p>Files is where your work lives. Share a link instead of emailing "
"attachments, so everyone works in the same copy.</p><p>In this tour you make "
"a folder, see how to share it and learn how to undo mistakes.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:118
msgid "➕ Make a place for your work"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:120
msgid ""
"<p>Let's start with a folder of your own: click <strong>New</strong>.</"
"p><p>No New button? Open a folder you can add to, such as a project folder.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:126
msgid "📤 Upload or create"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:128
msgid ""
"<p>Here you upload files, or a whole folder at once, and create new "
"documents to work on together.</p><p>For now, choose <strong>New folder</"
"strong>.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:134
msgid "✏️ Give it a name"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:136
msgid ""
"<p>Name it after something you're working on now, so it's useful right away "
"and others see what's inside.</p><p>Click <strong>Create</strong> first, "
"then click <strong>Next</strong>.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:142
msgid "🤝 Share a folder"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:144
msgid ""
"<p>Now click the share icon next to your new folder. Could not make one? Any "
"folder you can share will do.</p><p>The icon opens a panel that shows who "
"has access. Nothing gets shared yet.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:150
msgid "👥 Colleagues and teams"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:152
msgid ""
"<p>Type a colleague's name, a group or a team. Choose <strong>View only</"
"strong> or <strong>Allow upload and editing</strong>, then click "
"<strong>Save share</strong>.</p><p>Anything you add to the folder later is "
"shared too. You do not have to share anything now.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:157
msgid "🔗 Send a link, not a file"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:159
msgid ""
"<p>Copy the <strong>Internal link</strong> into a chat or an email instead "
"of attaching the file. Colleagues with access open this very folder, so "
"nobody works on an old copy.</p><p>The link itself does not give anyone "
"access.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:164
msgid "🌐 People outside your organization"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:166
msgid ""
"<p>Someone at another organization? Type their email address above, or their "
"federated cloud ID if they use Nextcloud too.</p><p>Or create a public link: "
"its <strong>⋯</strong> menu › <strong>Customize link</strong> adds a "
"password and an expiration date. Your organization may limit public links.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:171
msgid "💬 Activity and comments"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:173
msgid ""
"<p>The <strong>Activity</strong> tab shows what happened to this item, such "
"as who created, renamed or shared it.</p><p>You can also leave a comment "
"there for everyone with access.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:178
msgid "📥 Shared with you"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:180
msgid ""
"<p>Everything shared with you or by you is under <strong>Shares</strong>. "
"Folders shared with your group or project also show up in <strong>All files</"
"strong>.</p><p>A share from another Nextcloud server may wait in "
"<strong>Pending shares</strong>: open Shares with its arrow to accept it.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app; keep the emoji
#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Calendar app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:184
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:412
msgid "🗑️ Nothing is lost right away"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Files app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:186
msgid ""
"<p>Changed a file by mistake? In its details, <strong>Versions</strong> "
"brings back an earlier one. Deleted something? It stays in <strong>Deleted "
"files</strong> for a while.</p><p>That's it. Now drag your files into your "
"folder, and send links instead of attachments.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:192
msgid "💬 Welcome to Talk"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:194
msgid ""
"<p>Chat, calls and video meetings with your colleagues, right next to your "
"files.</p><p>In this tour you set up a conversation for your team, add "
"colleagues and see how calls, meetings and notifications work.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:197
msgid "🚀 A conversation for your team"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:199
msgid ""
"<p>A group conversation keeps a team's messages, files and calls in one "
"place, instead of long email threads.</p><p>Let's make one: click the "
"highlighted button. If it is not there, click <strong>Home</strong> at the "
"top left.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:205
msgid "✏️ Name it after real work"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:207
msgid ""
"<p>Type the name of a team, project or research group you work with, then "
"click <strong>Next</strong>. Leave the other options as they are.</"
"p><p>Already have a team conversation? Close this with ✕, then click "
"<strong>Next</strong>.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:213
msgid "✅ Create it"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:215
msgid "<p>Click the highlighted button to create the conversation.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:221
msgid "👥 Add your colleagues"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:223
msgid ""
"<p>In <strong>Participants</strong> on the right (open the sidebar if "
"needed), type a colleague's or group's name and pick them. They get a "
"notification.</p><p>External partners? Invite them by email in a separate "
"conversation, if your organization allows guests.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:228
msgid "✍️ Say what it is for"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:230
msgid ""
"<p>Write a first message, for example what this conversation is for, and "
"send it.</p><p>The <strong>+</strong> button shares one of your files, so "
"everyone works in the same copy.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:235
msgid "📞 Call with one click"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:237
msgid ""
"<p>Need to talk? <strong>Start call</strong> notifies everyone in the "
"conversation, and they join with one click. You can share your screen too.</"
"p><p>No need to try it now: it would ring them all.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:242
msgid "📅 Plan a meeting"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:244
msgid ""
"<p>Next to <strong>Start call</strong>, the calendar button lists upcoming "
"meetings. <strong>Schedule a meeting</strong> puts one in your calendar and "
"invites everyone here.</p><p>At meeting time, everyone opens this "
"conversation and joins the call.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:249
msgid "🔔 Choose what you hear"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:251
msgid ""
"<p>Each conversation has its own setting: hover over it, click the three "
"dots and open <strong>Notifications</strong>. Put your team's conversation "
"on <strong>All messages</strong>.</p><p>Someone chose <strong>@-mentions "
"only</strong>? Type <strong>@</strong> and their name to reach them.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:255
msgid "🏠 Start your day at Home"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:257
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Home</strong> shows your upcoming meetings, unread mentions and "
"message reminders.</p><p>Search your phone's app store for Nextcloud Talk, "
"so calls and messages reach you when this tab is closed.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:261
msgid "🔍 A quick question?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Talk app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:263
msgid ""
"<p>Next time you have a quick question, type a colleague's name here to "
"start a one-to-one chat. It also finds your conversations.</p><p>That's it. "
"Send your next team update in your team conversation instead of an email.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:269
msgid "🗂️ Welcome to Deck"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:271
msgid ""
"<p>Deck keeps track of tasks, your own or your team's, so everyone sees who "
"does what and what is due.</p><p>In this tour you add a task, give it a due "
"date and see where it comes back.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:274
msgid "📋 Open a board"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:276
msgid ""
"<p>Your boards are listed here, together with boards colleagues share with "
"you.</p><p>Click your <strong>Welcome</strong> board to practice: only you "
"can see it. No Welcome board? Open a board of your own.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:282
msgid "➕ Add a card"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:284
msgid ""
"<p>Each column is a list, such as To do or Done, and each card is a task. "
"Click the highlighted button to add one.</p><p>No button? You can only view "
"this board, or it has no lists yet. Click <strong>Back</strong> and open "
"another.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:290
msgid "✏️ What needs doing?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:292
msgid ""
"<p>Click in the field, type a real task, such as <em>Set up a board for my "
"project</em>, and press <strong>Enter</strong>. Your card appears in the "
"list and the field empties.</p><p>Only Enter saves it, so press Enter first, "
"then click <strong>Next</strong>.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:296
msgid "👆 Open your card"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:298
msgid ""
"<p>Your new card is at the bottom of the list. Click it to open it.</"
"p><p>Later on, drag cards to the next list as the work moves on, and up or "
"down to change their order.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:304
msgid "📅 Give it a due date"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:306
msgid ""
"<p>Click the <strong>+</strong> here and pick a date. Cards with a due date "
"come back in <strong>Upcoming cards</strong> and, if you use Calendar, in "
"your calendar.</p><p>On a shared board, you can assign the card to someone "
"in the field above; they get a notification.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:310
msgid "💬 Notes, comments and files"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:312
msgid ""
"<p>Keep everything about a task on its card: notes and checklists in the "
"description, discussion in the comments, files as attachments for everyone "
"on the board. Type @ in a comment to mention someone.</p><p>Now close the "
"card with ✕, then click <strong>Next</strong>.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:317
msgid "🤝 Work together"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:319
msgid ""
"<p>This button opens the board's details: share the board with colleagues, "
"groups or teams, and see who changed what.</p><p>People you add can only "
"view at first. Turn on <strong>Can edit</strong> for those who work on the "
"cards.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:324
msgid "📆 Upcoming cards"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:326
msgid ""
"<p>Now see your task come back: click <strong>Upcoming cards</strong>. It "
"gathers the open cards from all your boards in one view.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:332
msgid "⏰ What's due when"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:334
msgid ""
"<p>Your open cards from every board, assigned to you or to no one, sorted by "
"due date. Find your new card under the day you picked, or under <strong>No "
"due</strong>.</p><p>Finished? Click <strong>Mark as done</strong> on its "
"card, and it leaves this list.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:338
msgid "🚀 Make it yours"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Deck app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:340
msgid ""
"<p>That's it. Ready for real work? Add a board for each project or team, "
"give it your own lists and share it with the people involved.</p><p>The "
"cards on the Welcome board have more tips.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Calendar app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:346
msgid "📅 Welcome to Calendar"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Calendar app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:348
msgid ""
"<p>Plan meetings and time for your own work, and see when colleagues are "
"free.</p><p>In this tour you plan an event, then see how to invite "
"colleagues, share calendars and have them on your phone too.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Calendar app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:351
msgid "➕ Plan your first event"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of a step in the built-in tour of the Calendar app. Words in bold are labels in Nextcloud: use the words Nextcloud shows in your language
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:353
msgid ""
"<p>Let's plan something: click the highlighted button to start a new event.</"
"p><p>Later you can also click a day in the calendar, or drag across a few "
"hours in the week view.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a step in the built-in tour of the Calendar app; keep the emoji
#: lib/Service/BuiltinTours.php:359
msgid "👥 Meeting with others?"
msgstr ""

