#. TRANSLATORS src/personal/PersonalApp.vue:3
#: lib/Settings/AdminSection.php:28
#: lib/Settings/HelpSection.php:28
#: specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:2
#: specialVueFakeDummyForL10nScript.js:4399
#: templates/admin.php:7
msgid "IntroVox"
msgstr ""

#: specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:3
msgid "Guided tours for Nextcloud and its apps"
msgstr ""

#: specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:4
msgid ""
"IntroVox shows people around Nextcloud. New users get a welcome tour after "
"their first login, and a short tour the first time they open an app such as "
"Files, Talk, Deck or Calendar.\n"
"\n"
"**For users:**\n"
"* A welcome tour after the first login, in their own language\n"
"* Short tours the first time they open an app or a page, or a tip on any "
"page after a few days\n"
"* Steps that go on when they click the element or fill in a field; a step "
"whose element is not there yet waits aside until it appears\n"
"* Images, GIFs and videos in steps, with descriptions and captions\n"
"* Every tour can be started again from the personal settings, also through "
"Tours in the user menu, and tours that start by themselves can be switched "
"off\n"
"* An optional \"Getting started\" checklist on the Dashboard that ticks "
"itself off\n"
"\n"
"**For administrators:**\n"
"* Built-in tours for Files, Talk, Deck and Calendar, and tours of your own "
"for an app, a page, or anywhere\n"
"* Default steps translated in VoxCloud's Weblate (every translated language "
"is available automatically), with your own steps per language where you want "
"them\n"
"* Groups per step and per tour\n"
"* Who gets a tour and when: everyone or new accounts only, a number of days "
"after the first login, between two dates\n"
"* Share links that start a tour, for a welcome mail or a message to a team\n"
"* Statistics per tour: how many people started, completed and skipped it, "
"and how far people get\n"
"* Export and import of a whole tour, with its steps in every language and "
"its images and videos\n"
"* Translate a tour or write its steps with AI, through the Nextcloud "
"Assistant; you check every step before it is saved\n"
"* Optional anonymous telemetry reporting\n"
"* Automatically adapts to your Nextcloud theme (light, dark, high contrast)\n"
"\n"
"Built with Vue 3 and Shepherd.js."
msgstr ""

